# Shuffle Sort-Merge Join (SMJ) Execution Timeline
direction: right

stage1: "Stage 1: Network Shuffle\n• Hash(Key) % P\n• All-to-All network exchange\n• Co-locates matching keys" {
  style.stroke: "#3B82F6"
}

stage2: "Stage 2: Parallel Local Sort\n• Sorts partitions by key\n• External merge sort O(N log N)" {
  style.stroke: "#F59E0B"
}

stage3: "Stage 3: Linear Merge\n• Two-pointer streaming cursor\n• Single linear pass O(N+M)\n• Zero RAM spill risk" {
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
}

stage1 -> stage2 -> stage3
